"""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""
" Inspired_by::
"   https://github.com/amix/vimrc
"
" Sections:
"   -> General
"   -> Plugins
"   -> VIM user interface
"   -> Colors and Fonts
"   -> Files and backups
"   -> Text, tab and indent related
"   -> Visual mode related
"   -> Moving around, tabs and buffers
"   -> Editing mappings
"   -> Spell checking
"   -> Misc
"   -> Helper functions
